# The app icon picked in Settings comes back with the Dock icon (GitHub #319). With "Keep Cra in the
# menu bar", ⌘Q takes Cra out of the Dock and New Window brings it back. macOS registers it anew with
# the bundle's icon then, and the ⌘-Tab switcher showed Segments until the icon was picked again.
# What ⌘-Tab draws can't be read here (docs/release-checklist.md), so this pins that Cra sets the
# icon again on the way back.
# promise: #319
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false, "keepInMenuBar": true}
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=icon
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
reject-log app icon: \S+ set again
cra://debug?quit=menu
wait 2
expect-log menu bar: quit keeps Cra in the menu bar
cra://action/newWindow
wait 3
expect-log menu bar: browser windows back
expect-log app icon: \S+ set again, back in the Dock
